      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "So FYI, 7.1 DOES work, but it seems incredibly picky about the codec. Specifically only EAC3 7.1 seems to work, encoded with the official Dolby Pro encoder.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
